{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:0ed9af7542a2d11b","name":"Speeder Traffic","source":{"id":"source:reference-0ed9af7542a2d11b","title":"Speeder Traffic","revision":21449,"timestamp":"2024-08-26T01:49:23Z","sha256":"f724d9ba1b91efb4e9aa10a92470e37e046812de08c3d13b7ea466191010fa49","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=21449","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Speeder%20Traffic&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-0ed9af7542a2d11b","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Unknown Regions Campaign Guide"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Unknown_Regions_Campaign_Guide"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Dozens of speeders zip by as you attempt to cross to the other side of the thoroughfare."]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["The last thing that speeder pilots want to see in their path is a bunch of creatures in the middle of a fight. Nevertheless, combatants who find themselves in speeder lanes can use the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Vehicles"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Vehicles"}," in a variety of ways. If combatants put the speeders between themselves and their opponents, the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Vehicles"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Vehicles"}," can provide ",{"tag":"a","children":["Cover"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Cover"}," or prevent their foes from reaching them. If the combatants join the traffic to continue their battle between or atop the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Vehicles"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Vehicles"},", they can use the speeders as island platforms from which to launch their assaults.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h2","children":["Speeder Traffic Statistics (CL 8)"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Keywords:"]}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Artificial"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Artificial"},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Trigger:"]}," A being begins its turn within Speeder Traffic.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Attack:"]}," +10 vs ",{"tag":"a","children":["Reflex Defense"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Reflex_Defense"},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Damage:"]}," 4d6\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Recurrence:"]}," Each round at the start of the target's turn, as long as the target remains within Speeder Traffic.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Suggested ",{"tag":"a","children":["Skills"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Skills","referenceId":"reference:66d0f523a379b2de"},":"]}," The following are suggested ",{"tag":"a","children":["Skills"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Skills","referenceId":"reference:66d0f523a379b2de"}," for this Hazard:\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"ul","children":[{"tag":"li","children":[{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Acrobatics"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Acrobatics","referenceId":"reference:0d0b7eee2953750e"}," (DC 23):"]},"  The character weaves and tumbles through the Speeder Traffic, gaining a +2 circumstance bonus to ",{"tag":"a","children":["Reflex Defense"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Reflex_Defense"}," against the Hazard."]},"\n",{"tag":"li","children":[{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Jump"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Jump","referenceId":"reference:9ee0ca3e24d60ea0"}," (DC 23):"]}," The character jumps out of the way of an oncoming speeder or makes an effort to leap from one speeder to another, gaining a +2 circumstance bonus to ",{"tag":"a","children":["Reflex Defense"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Reflex_Defense"}," against the Hazard."]},"\n",{"tag":"li","children":[{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Perception"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Perception","referenceId":"reference:bd18e320a6bb9f53"}," (DC 18):"]}," The character watches carefully for oncoming speeders, gaining a +1 circumstance bonus to ",{"tag":"a","children":["Reflex Defense"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Reflex_Defense"}," against the Hazard's attacks."]}]},"\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
